(text "No battery connection here. VBUS target: 5 V from USB source.\nA8/B8 intentionally NC. SHIELD is S1 on the GCT footprint.\nCC sense at charger: high impedance, including while unpowered; no extra Rd.\nDP/DM: source classification only. Available current must be detected.\nInput protection, current limit, reverse blocking and 2S charger: separate board." (at 35.56 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1117b2b-b773-5a7f-a00c-8a912ef43a27"))
